---
const buildings=[{id:'A',x:245,y:235,side:'left'},{id:'B',x:245,y:355,side:'left'},{id:'C',x:245,y:475,side:'left'},{id:'D',x:820,y:235,side:'right'},{id:'E',x:820,y:355,side:'right'},{id:'F',x:820,y:475,side:'right'}];
---
<section class="guitar-learning" data-representational-neglect aria-label="Imagined viewpoint and reported landmarks">
  <div class="guitar-actions"><div><h2>Change the imagined viewpoint</h2><p>The landmarks stay fixed. Follow which ones enter the report.</p></div><div class="guitar-buttons"><button type="button" data-viewpoint="duomo" aria-pressed="true">Face the Duomo</button><button type="button" data-viewpoint="away" aria-pressed="false">Face away</button><button type="button" data-viewpoint="compare" aria-pressed="false">Compare reports</button></div></div>
  <div class="learning-screen">
    <svg class="learning-circuit imagined-square" viewBox="0 0 1280 650" role="img" aria-labelledby="square-title square-desc">
      <title id="square-title">Neglect within an imagined town square</title><desc id="square-desc">The Duomo stays at the top of the schematic square. Buildings A, B, and C stay on the screen's left, D, E, and F on its right. Patients reported landmarks to their imagined right. Turning around changes which landmarks are reported.</desc>
      <text x="48" y="32" class="diagram-eyebrow">REPRESENTATIONAL SPACE</text><text x="48" y="76" class="diagram-heading">Same memory, a different viewpoint</text><text x="48" y="110" class="diagram-note">Bisiach &amp; Luzzatti · two patients · schematic landmarks, not a historical map</text>
      <rect x="170" y="140" width="850" height="470" rx="8" fill="#f4f0e5" stroke="#c7cfc3"/>
      <g><path d="M520 190V158L595 123L670 158V190Z" fill="#e4e9e3" stroke="#1d3552" stroke-width="2"/><text x="595" y="178" text-anchor="middle" class="square-label">Duomo</text></g>
      {buildings.map(b=><g data-landmark={b.id} data-world-side={b.side} class="square-building"><rect x={b.x} y={b.y} width="125" height="65" rx="3"/><path d={`M${b.x-7} ${b.y}L${b.x+62} ${b.y-29}L${b.x+132} ${b.y}`} fill="none" stroke="#1d3552" stroke-width="2"/><text x={b.x+62} y={b.y+42} text-anchor="middle" class="square-letter">{b.id}</text></g>)}
      <g data-square-observer transform="translate(595 555)"><circle r="17" fill="#1d3552"/><path d="M0 -23V-63M-10 -50L0 -63L10 -50" fill="none" stroke="#1d3552" stroke-width="4"/></g>
      <text x="595" y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="square-label" data-square-facing>Imagined viewpoint</text><text x="595" y="371" text-anchor="middle" class="diagram-note" data-square-report>Reveal the report</text>
      <text x="1045" y="195" class="square-label">Report key</text><rect x="1047" y="225" width="16" height="16" fill="#418329"/><text x="1075" y="240" class="diagram-note">Facing Duomo</text><rect x="1047" y="269" width="16" height="16" fill="#7b589b"/><text x="1075" y="284" class="diagram-note">Facing away</text><text x="1045" y="339" class="diagram-note">All buildings</text><text x="1045" y="365" class="diagram-note">stay available</text><text x="1045" y="391" class="diagram-note">in memory.</text>
      <text x="170" y="638" class="diagram-note" data-square-summary>“Right” follows the imagined observer, not a fixed screen side.</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="learning-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-square-stage>1 / 3 · VIEWPOINT</span><p data-square-caption>Imagine standing in the square, facing the Duomo. The building symbols mark the spatial knowledge available to describe.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="learning-controls"><button type="button" data-square-prev disabled>← Previous step</button><button type="button" data-square-next>Next step →</button><button type="button" data-square-reset>↺ Reset</button><button type="button" data-illustration-fullscreen>⛶ Fullscreen</button></div>
  <p class="learning-limit">An illustration of the reported study. Omitted landmarks remain in the map; changing viewpoint reveals that the spatial knowledge was not erased.</p>
</section>
<style>
  .square-label{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;fill:#1d3552}.square-letter{font-size:28px;font-weight:600;fill:#1d3552}.square-building rect{fill:#e5e9e2;stroke:#8b9c9f;stroke-width:2;transition:fill .6s,stroke .6s}.square-building{transition:opacity .6s}.square-building.is-unreported{opacity:.4}.square-building.report-duomo rect{fill:#dce9d4;stroke:#418329;stroke-width:4}.square-building.report-away rect{fill:#e6ddf0;stroke:#7b589b;stroke-width:4}[data-viewpoint][aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#c8ba88;background:#35392c}
</style>
